{
  "url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2102.06617",
  "prompt": "Quote verbatim the paragraphs and equations describing how EUHFORIA sets the inner-boundary (0.1 AU) conditions from the WSA coronal model: the speed formula with all constants, density, temperature/pressure, magnetic field (B_r) prescriptions with values (n_fsw, v_fsw, B_fsw, P, T), the 0.1 AU boundary, gamma, grid, the outer boundary, and whether the inner boundary maps rotate (frame). Give section and equation numbers."
}

{
  "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.01613",
  "prompt": "Give the title, authors, date, journal (if any), and full abstract. Does it describe an idealized high-speed stream simulation setup (boundary speeds, density, temperature, B, inner radius, tilt) and quantitative results (compression, shock formation distance)?"
}

{
  "command": "which pdftotext python3; python3 -c \"import fitz\" 2>&1; python3 -c \"import pypdf\" 2>&1",
  "description": "Check for PDF text extraction tools"
}

{
  "command": "cd /tmp/claude-1000/-mnt-c-Users-cabot-OneDrive-Documents-Research-Cambridge-X3I/c4794a53-4881-4aa9-8b9b-7c033457fa8b/scratchpad/lit1/pdf && grep -n -i -E \"675|300 cm|3.3 nPa|0.8 MK|300 nT|1\\.5|gamma|adiabatic|21.5|0.1 au|0.1 AU|v_fsw|fsw|V0|V1|0.222|1.25|β|rotat\" 2102.06617.txt | head -80",
  "description": "Grep EUHFORIA boundary prescription in MULTI-VP paper"
}

